' The entry module of a Godot *project* (a folder). `vbr rungodot examples/godot_game`
' compiles main.vbr + its sibling modules into one GDExtension.
'
' `main.vbr` holds the main scene's root node; it may call sibling modules by
' qualified name (`Combat.Damage`). Nodes can live in any module — gdext registers
' them all. Assets (like main.tscn here) are copied into the Godot project.

Node2D "Game"
    On Ready
        Debug.Print "game starting; a 15-hit leaves " & Combat.Damage(100, 15) & " hp"
    End Ready
End Node2D
